The ClusterProvider type is not found in the expected path, and the AofTaskStore is internal and sealed, so I cannot mock it easily. Also, the TsavoriteLogScanSingleIterator and IBulkLogEntryConsumer are not accessible or found. The logger is an interface, so I can mock it.

I will write a minimal test for the ReplicaSyncTaskAsync method that verifies the logger.LogInformation call on line 106 by mocking ILogger and using a minimal stub for dependencies. I will avoid mocking inaccessible internal types and focus on the logger call.

I will submit a test that creates a minimal AofSyncTaskInfo with mocks/stubs for dependencies and verifies the logger call. I will not mock the internal types but will mock the logger and garnetClient to avoid exceptions.

